OL,5,G1005 Secrets of the Royal Palaces
OL,6,     FQueen Victoria and Prince Albert
OL,7,     Fbought Osborne House in 1840 as
OL,8,     Ftheir perfect hideaway on the Isle
OL,9,     Fof Wight. Plus the TV battle over
OL,10,     Fthe broadcast of the Queen
OL,11,     FMother's funeral.
OL,12,G1105 Secrets of the Royal Palaces
OL,13,     FHow, in 1698, Nottingham House was
OL,14,     Fbought and renovated by William
OL,15,     FIII, turning it into Kensington
OL,16,     FPalace. Plus; the event where
OL,17,     FPrincess Diana wore her famous
OL,18,     F'revenge' dress.
